    "updated_at": "2021-04-22T12:38:33Z",
    "body": "I noodled on this a bit in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/6315.\r\n\r\nA [session history entry](https://whatpr.org/html/6315/history.html#session-history-entry) has a [document state](https://whatpr.org/html/6315/history.html#document-state) (which is shared between history entries that should share the same document), which has a resource which is a null, a [srcdoc resource](https://whatpr.org/html/6315/history.html#srcdoc-resource), or a [POST resource](https://whatpr.org/html/6315/history.html#post-resource).\r\n\r\n`pushState`, `replaceState`, and `document.open()` go through [URL and history update steps](https://whatpr.org/html/6315/history.html#url-and-history-update-steps), which removes any POST resource in step 5.",
